WEBVTT

00:07.896 --> 00:13.656
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.156 --> 00:19.746
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.746 --> 00:19.786
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.786 --> 00:28.336
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.336 --> 00:30.206
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.586 --> 00:34.136
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.466 --> 00:37.966
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.466 --> 00:40.806
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.806 --> 00:45.556
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.686 --> 00:48.896
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.856 --> 00:51.856
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.406 --> 01:01.116
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.446 --> 01:03.456
...with you.
futaride

01:04.456 --> 01:10.166
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.836 --> 01:16.256
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.466 --> 01:24.766
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.766 --> 01:26.596
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:41.096 --> 01:43.436
Shiratori-san, good morning.

01:44.776 --> 01:46.896
It's another nice day.

01:47.186 --> 01:49.356
I-Is it really?

01:49.776 --> 01:52.156
Are you getting used to life here?

01:52.866 --> 01:55.116
Well, yes.

01:56.076 --> 01:58.206
Shiratori-kun, hand me the snacks!

01:59.076 --> 02:05.046
I think I shouldn't be getting used to a life of partying all night, every night...

02:08.416 --> 02:09.546
Miss Landlady?

02:09.546 --> 02:11.586
Are you tired?

02:12.716 --> 02:14.386
Hold on a second.

02:16.136 --> 02:17.306
Here.

02:17.306 --> 02:18.726
Have one.

02:19.346 --> 02:21.436
They're good when you're tired.

02:21.936 --> 02:23.896
Are they umeboshi?

02:23.896 --> 02:24.606
Yes.

02:31.566 --> 02:32.736
How was that?

02:32.736 --> 02:35.826
I feel better, I think.

02:36.616 --> 02:38.076
That's good.

02:38.616 --> 02:40.156
Thank you, Miss Landlady.

02:41.076 --> 02:42.996
I'm off now.

02:45.836 --> 02:47.626
Have a good day...

02:50.546 --> 02:52.966
What's wrong?

02:52.966 --> 02:55.596
Shiratori-san still looks tired.

02:56.006 --> 02:57.886
Are you worried?

02:59.516 --> 03:01.596
So you are worried.

03:04.646 --> 03:05.356
Okay everyone, how are you?

03:05.356 --> 03:05.556
Tama Check
Okay everyone, how are you?

03:05.556 --> 03:08.776
Hou Design School
Tama Check
Okay everyone, how are you?

03:08.776 --> 03:10.356
Please turn in the assignment I gave you yesterday.
Tama Check
Hou Design School

03:10.356 --> 03:10.986
Hou Design School
Please turn in the assignment I gave you yesterday.

03:10.986 --> 03:13.566
Please turn in the assignment I gave you yesterday.

03:13.566 --> 03:18.536
I couldn't imagine that anyone would forget it, right?

03:19.196 --> 03:25.496
I never imagined that school would be the most relaxing place.

03:25.956 --> 03:28.626
Shiratori-kun, are you happy?

03:28.626 --> 03:30.626
Yes, I am.

03:30.626 --> 03:33.006
That's wonderful.

03:33.006 --> 03:34.296
Where's your homework?

03:34.296 --> 03:35.506
I forgot.

03:37.216 --> 03:41.016
Oh, that's not good.

03:41.466 --> 03:43.056
You forgot your homework...

03:43.556 --> 03:46.646
...and you don't pay attention during class.

03:46.646 --> 03:48.316
You've got some guts.

03:51.356 --> 03:54.906
Please excuse us for a minute.

03:58.116 --> 04:02.076
Kou Design School

04:09.586 --> 04:12.006
Welcome home, Shiratori-san.

04:21.306 --> 04:22.816
Hello.

04:23.006 --> 04:24.426
Hello.

04:24.426 --> 04:25.516
Yup.

04:30.686 --> 04:33.686
No, that's not it! T-Tamami-chan!

04:33.686 --> 04:36.106
You came into my room without permission again!

04:36.106 --> 04:37.986
You're slow.

04:38.156 --> 04:39.656
Do you want something from me?

04:39.656 --> 04:40.866
Yes.

04:40.866 --> 04:45.036
Actually, I'm in big trouble.

04:45.036 --> 04:47.416
Oh, how troublesome.

04:47.416 --> 04:49.666
She doesn't look like she's in trouble.

04:49.916 --> 04:56.296
But you look sleepy, so I'll deal with it myself.

04:56.676 --> 04:59.676
That would help me.

05:07.056 --> 05:10.016
But it would be very troubling to do by myself.

05:10.016 --> 05:11.266
Very troubling.

05:13.226 --> 05:14.356
That's...

05:14.776 --> 05:17.566
Oh, how troublesome.

05:17.566 --> 05:20.866
I wonder if anyone can help.

05:21.066 --> 05:24.326
What's so great about umeboshi, Kozue-chan?

05:24.326 --> 05:25.616
Aren't you curious too, Bara-san?

05:25.946 --> 05:27.366
No, I'm not.

05:27.366 --> 05:28.036
Oh?

05:28.036 --> 05:29.616
Are you going out now?

05:30.076 --> 05:33.456
Yes, I need to go out to pick up something I left behind.

05:33.456 --> 05:35.206
Then I'll come, too.

05:35.206 --> 05:36.206
Oh, no.

05:36.206 --> 05:39.426
Shiratori-san is coming along with me.

05:39.426 --> 05:41.506
Right, Shiratori-san?

05:41.506 --> 05:42.136
Y-Yeah.

05:42.886 --> 05:43.806
But...

05:43.806 --> 05:46.676
Kozue-chan, it's your turn to clean the bathrooms today.

05:46.676 --> 05:47.426
Yes...

05:47.476 --> 05:49.766
We will be right back.

05:53.396 --> 05:54.976
Don't run away, Mom!

05:54.976 --> 05:56.356
Just a little more!

05:56.356 --> 05:59.606
We only have a bit more, so let's do it!

06:02.736 --> 06:04.576
A little more...

06:06.866 --> 06:09.616
A little more, and I will be free.

06:12.286 --> 06:14.456
Mom!

06:18.086 --> 06:19.296
Um...

06:19.296 --> 06:21.586
OK, Shiratori-san, let's go.

06:22.136 --> 06:23.546
See you later.

06:23.546 --> 06:24.676
Do it right.

06:24.676 --> 06:26.096
Yes.

06:26.506 --> 06:28.426
So, where did you leave this thing?

06:28.426 --> 06:29.976
At my school.

06:29.976 --> 06:33.606
Isn't your school close to the station?

06:33.606 --> 06:34.146
Yes.

06:34.726 --> 06:37.146
Seika Tandai Fuzoku Koukou,

06:37.146 --> 06:39.736
SeiTanKu for short.

06:39.736 --> 06:42.316
By the way, it's a girls' school.

06:42.656 --> 06:45.276
Oh, it's a girls' school.

06:45.276 --> 06:49.036
That sounds dangerously sweet.

06:49.746 --> 06:51.996
Shiratori-san, you pervert!

06:52.166 --> 06:53.166
Pervert!

06:53.326 --> 06:54.246
Pervert!

06:54.456 --> 06:55.416
Pervert!

06:55.586 --> 06:56.586
Pervert!

06:56.796 --> 06:58.126
Pervert!

06:59.586 --> 07:00.916
Hey...

07:05.096 --> 07:06.046
What?

07:07.216 --> 07:09.386
Please excuse me.

07:11.426 --> 07:13.136
Um...

07:15.686 --> 07:17.186
I see...

07:18.226 --> 07:19.146
Let me see...

07:19.396 --> 07:21.816
Hey, what's this about?

07:21.816 --> 07:23.106
I see.

07:23.106 --> 07:26.776
You are 175cm, and 55kg.

07:28.116 --> 07:29.156
She's right on.

07:29.156 --> 07:31.156
How could she tell with just that?

07:32.746 --> 07:37.336
By the way, are you dating anyone?

07:38.916 --> 07:40.586
Why, all of a sudden?

07:40.586 --> 07:42.126
Are you?

07:43.626 --> 07:45.466
Are you not?

07:46.716 --> 07:48.466
I'm not...

07:48.466 --> 07:49.426
I see.

07:50.346 --> 07:52.176
That's good.

07:53.226 --> 07:54.686
Let's go.

07:55.726 --> 08:00.066
Why is it good that I'm not dating anyone?

08:00.526 --> 08:01.606
It's as if...

08:03.026 --> 08:04.486
Tamami-chan...

08:05.816 --> 08:06.986
It can't be.

08:07.196 --> 08:08.986
We're almost there.

08:08.986 --> 08:09.986
Hurry.

08:09.986 --> 08:11.156
Oh, yes.

08:11.536 --> 08:15.996
Seiko Tandai Fuzoku Koukou

08:19.786 --> 08:22.916
Be sure to follow me.

08:22.916 --> 08:23.296
Yeah.

08:26.216 --> 08:29.006
Wow, my first time in a girls' school.

08:29.006 --> 08:31.306
It's making me a bit nervous.

08:32.096 --> 08:35.266
Is being at a girls' school that different for you?

08:36.686 --> 08:38.226
Well, yeah.

08:38.226 --> 08:39.646
I went to a boys' school.

08:40.106 --> 08:42.686
Oh? A boys' school?

08:44.486 --> 08:46.106
What is it?

08:46.106 --> 08:49.276
Shiratori-san, do you happen to be...

08:49.526 --> 08:50.656
What?

08:50.656 --> 08:52.116
What are you trying to say?

08:52.906 --> 08:55.116
Oh, nothing.

08:55.616 --> 08:56.956
I see.

08:56.956 --> 08:58.706
A boys' school, huh?

08:58.706 --> 09:00.126
I see.

09:01.086 --> 09:05.046
I feel that she took that completely wrong.

09:05.586 --> 09:06.466
Shiratori-san!

09:08.546 --> 09:09.926
Hurry, hurry!

09:09.926 --> 09:11.386
This way!

09:25.309 --> 09:27.059
Get delicious.

09:31.859 --> 09:33.779
Oh, that's not the way.

09:33.779 --> 09:35.109
Like this?

09:35.109 --> 09:36.409
Yes, that's it.

09:38.949 --> 09:40.539
Hey, that's mine.

09:40.539 --> 09:42.369
Don't be picky.

09:45.999 --> 09:46.249
Iron Weights

09:46.249 --> 09:48.999
At the Girls' School
Iron Weights

09:48.999 --> 09:51.999
Iron Weights

09:54.419 --> 09:57.509
Iron Weights

10:02.009 --> 10:04.019
Thank you so much.

10:09.769 --> 10:12.779
Lost Item...

10:33.549 --> 10:36.219
Thanks for saving me, Tamami-chan.

10:36.219 --> 10:37.339
Otama!

10:38.509 --> 10:40.339
You haven't gone home yet?

10:40.339 --> 10:42.929
Oh, archery girls!

10:42.929 --> 10:45.059
Oh, I have business to take care of.

10:45.059 --> 10:45.599
I see...

10:46.479 --> 10:47.849
So, who is he?

10:47.849 --> 10:49.349
Oh, he is...

10:50.059 --> 10:52.149
Hello.

10:52.149 --> 10:53.779
Well...

10:54.399 --> 10:58.609
He's the pervert that I caught in the act in the locker room.

11:00.949 --> 11:03.159
What are you saying, Tamami-chan!?

11:03.159 --> 11:04.699
Correct yourself right now!

11:05.119 --> 11:07.329
That was mean, Tamami-chan.

11:07.329 --> 11:09.619
They were almost going to shoot me.

11:09.619 --> 11:13.039
That's because you're checking out anyone and everyone.

11:13.039 --> 11:13.709
Checking out?

11:14.379 --> 11:17.719
Checking out... that's not true.

11:17.719 --> 11:19.549
Hey, by the way,

11:20.129 --> 11:22.639
are you in a club or anything?

11:24.099 --> 11:26.429
Actually, I am,

11:26.429 --> 11:28.349
although I'm an inactive member.

11:28.349 --> 11:29.559
Oh, which one?

11:30.599 --> 11:32.059
The Occ Lab.

11:33.479 --> 11:34.569
The Occ Lab?

11:34.569 --> 11:37.189
The Occult Research Lab.

11:37.189 --> 11:38.569
Occult...

11:40.609 --> 11:42.949
(citing a spell)

11:42.949 --> 11:45.659
I demand in the name of me!

11:46.289 --> 11:48.869
That's too good!

11:49.749 --> 11:52.209
What's too good?

11:52.209 --> 11:54.209
Oh, nothing.

11:54.209 --> 11:56.549
Don't you have to attend the club meetings?

11:56.549 --> 12:00.929
It's okay, because I'm an inactive member.

12:08.849 --> 12:13.099
Member Tamami.

12:14.229 --> 12:16.479
Don't get involved with her.

12:16.479 --> 12:17.979
Let's just go.

12:18.399 --> 12:21.489
It's no use trying to escape.

12:22.859 --> 12:24.489
Who is this?

12:24.489 --> 12:26.699
She's the president of the Occ Lab.

12:26.699 --> 12:28.289
Thank you for the introduction.

12:28.699 --> 12:31.539
You even prepared the sacrifice.

12:31.539 --> 12:33.079
Good work.

12:33.079 --> 12:35.289
Let us start the Sabbath.

12:35.839 --> 12:38.209
Can we do this tomorrow?

12:38.209 --> 12:39.459
Sacrifice?

12:39.459 --> 12:41.299
Give me a break.

12:41.629 --> 12:43.009
Fine.

12:43.009 --> 12:45.009
We are starting the Sabbath right now.

12:45.719 --> 12:49.849
I told you, not today.

12:49.849 --> 12:52.019
You immoral, cunning Satan-maniac.

12:52.269 --> 12:55.349
Immoral, cunning Satan-maniac...

12:56.189 --> 12:58.019
Pale-faced otaku zombie.

13:00.069 --> 13:03.029
Otaku... zombie...

13:03.359 --> 13:06.159
Maybe you should stop...

13:06.159 --> 13:08.079
She seems to be upset.

13:08.079 --> 13:09.409
It's okay.

13:09.409 --> 13:10.539
Now's our chance.

13:11.249 --> 13:14.209
We'd better leave people like this alone.

13:15.079 --> 13:18.459
So Tamami-chan has a type of person she doesn't like.

13:21.259 --> 13:25.009
Oh, those razor sharp words of abuse.

13:25.009 --> 13:27.139
Please rebuke me more!

13:27.139 --> 13:31.809
Curse me more and more!

13:37.809 --> 13:39.939
They got away.

13:39.939 --> 13:43.149
I'll let you go for today.

13:46.029 --> 13:48.779
Clean and shine.

13:53.449 --> 13:55.039
Good!

13:56.499 --> 13:58.579
998...

13:59.129 --> 14:02.669
999...

14:02.669 --> 14:04.379
We're doing well, Mom.

14:04.919 --> 14:07.259
A sunset beer is nice, too.

14:07.259 --> 14:08.589
It is.

14:09.219 --> 14:10.929
Right about now, Tama-chan is...

14:12.679 --> 14:15.809
This is my classroom.

14:15.809 --> 14:19.269
Kozue-chan is in the same class, too.

14:20.439 --> 14:20.729
Aoba

14:20.729 --> 14:23.689
This is Kozue-chan's desk.
Aoba

14:27.279 --> 14:28.949
Oh, she drew something on it.

14:29.699 --> 14:32.159
Is this a puppy?

14:32.159 --> 14:34.699
That's so like her.

14:37.619 --> 14:38.499
This is...

14:38.499 --> 14:40.919
This is what I left behind.

14:40.919 --> 14:42.919
Left behind?

14:43.589 --> 14:45.339
Is this a bonsai?

14:45.339 --> 14:47.129
Isn't it a great black pine?

14:47.589 --> 14:51.389
Don't you think these branches are magnificent?

14:51.389 --> 14:51.929
Uh...

14:52.889 --> 14:55.349
When I was taking a walk in the schoolyard,

14:55.349 --> 15:00.599
I happened to find the principal's bonsai collection, and I was looking at them.

15:00.599 --> 15:04.399
He asked, "Do you understand the greatness of these bonsai?"

15:04.399 --> 15:06.989
So I answered "Yes."

15:06.989 --> 15:12.739
Then he said "Wonderful!" and gave me one.

15:12.739 --> 15:16.369
But it was a little too heavy to carry home.

15:16.369 --> 15:18.209
Yes, it does look heavy.

15:19.289 --> 15:22.039
It was a little too heavy to carry home.

15:24.419 --> 15:25.709
You mean...

15:27.719 --> 15:30.009
A little too heavy...

15:32.469 --> 15:35.059
Should we walk a little slower?

15:45.609 --> 15:47.779
Excuse me, the towel...

15:50.449 --> 15:52.779
There's a pervert by the tennis court!

15:57.869 --> 15:59.329
I'm home.

15:59.329 --> 16:00.659
Welcome home.

16:01.709 --> 16:02.959
I'm home.

16:05.169 --> 16:07.669
Welcome home, Shiratori-san.

16:08.759 --> 16:10.839
The bath is ready.

16:11.469 --> 16:14.219
OK, thank you.

16:16.889 --> 16:18.469
That was tiring.

16:19.429 --> 16:23.559
I ended up being pushed around by Tamami-chan all day.

16:24.189 --> 16:28.069
Nothing good happens when I get involved with her.

16:29.149 --> 16:31.069
I can hear you.

16:33.989 --> 16:35.909
Oh boy.

16:35.909 --> 16:38.039
Tamami-chan, well...

16:38.039 --> 16:44.419
Shiratori-san, you're really the type who gets involved in every sort of trouble.

16:44.999 --> 16:47.629
You should've just passed by all those things at the school,

16:47.629 --> 16:50.459
but you stuck your head in, and got involved...

16:50.459 --> 16:52.339
I don't want to hear that from you.

16:52.339 --> 16:56.849
Have you always gotten involved like that?

16:58.179 --> 17:03.229
Come to think of it, it does feel like I get pushed around by my surroundings.

17:04.019 --> 17:06.059
That's tough.

17:06.059 --> 17:08.439
Don't you get tired?

17:08.439 --> 17:10.479
Or want to run away from it?

17:11.359 --> 17:12.899
Well, yeah.

17:13.649 --> 17:17.159
And today, too.

17:17.159 --> 17:20.079
I'm sure there'll be a party when you get back to your room.

17:20.999 --> 17:26.129
Don't you wish you could move somewhere else, or be free?

17:26.709 --> 17:29.959
You wouldn't have to get involved if you were living alone.

17:32.919 --> 17:34.759
I understand.

17:34.759 --> 17:38.349
It's not easy being pushed around.

17:38.349 --> 17:40.139
It's not that bad.

17:43.099 --> 17:45.849
Not everything is all bad.

17:47.349 --> 17:52.989
Sure, I often think it's tough while being involved in all that fuss,

17:52.989 --> 17:55.649
but there are memories being made from all of it too.

17:56.739 --> 18:04.159
Be it a good memory or a bad memory, they are all important parts of what makes me myself.

18:04.829 --> 18:09.209
So I don't hate who I am too much.

18:09.919 --> 18:14.169
Is it bad to justify it like that?

18:18.339 --> 18:19.719
Oh, no.

18:19.719 --> 18:22.429
It's very optimistic and good.

18:22.429 --> 18:24.019
R-Really?

18:24.019 --> 18:28.519
You really can't change your character so easily.

18:28.519 --> 18:30.189
You think so, too?

18:30.689 --> 18:33.939
Memories are the only thing you can take to the afterlife.

18:34.529 --> 18:36.199
That's not a positive expression.

18:37.359 --> 18:40.119
I'm glad I asked you.

18:40.989 --> 18:44.289
I could learn a little about you, too.

18:44.289 --> 18:48.749
I'm relieved to hear that you like getting involved.

18:48.749 --> 18:51.129
I'll be counting on you in the future too.

18:56.299 --> 18:58.469
Thank you for earlier.

18:58.469 --> 18:59.349
Sure.

19:02.509 --> 19:04.849
You know, Shiratori-san,

19:04.849 --> 19:06.309
to me...

19:07.769 --> 19:14.069
...to me, Kozue-chan is a very precious friend that cannot be replaced by anything.

19:14.609 --> 19:19.529
I want to do everything that will make her happy.

19:19.529 --> 19:22.319
That's how I think secretly.

19:23.329 --> 19:25.489
I'm such a good friend.

19:27.119 --> 19:30.869
Kozue-chan has been happy since you arrived here.

19:30.869 --> 19:34.749
When Kozue-chan is happy, I am happy too.

19:35.339 --> 19:40.759
Well, be a good friend to her from now on, too.

19:44.429 --> 19:45.719
How was the bath?

19:46.769 --> 19:48.059
Shiratori-san?

19:48.059 --> 19:49.139
Um...

19:49.139 --> 19:52.059
There is nothing to worry about with him.

19:52.059 --> 19:56.359
He was just a little tired in the morning, but he's fine.

19:56.939 --> 19:59.319
Right, Shiratori-san?

19:59.319 --> 19:59.899
Y-Yes.

20:00.359 --> 20:01.779
That's good.

20:01.779 --> 20:04.409
I was worried this morning.

20:04.869 --> 20:05.869
Thanks.

20:06.989 --> 20:11.329
Anyway, Kozue-chan, listen to this about Shiratori-san!

20:11.329 --> 20:12.789
What is it?

20:12.789 --> 20:16.499
He couldn't stop looking around at all the high school girls!

20:17.209 --> 20:20.089
Maybe it was all new to him.

20:20.089 --> 20:21.629
I heard he's from a boys' school.

20:23.049 --> 20:24.599
Is something the matter?

20:25.259 --> 20:26.099
Oh, nothing.

20:27.349 --> 20:30.479
I was just thinking that you two really are close friends.

20:30.889 --> 20:32.189
Yes.

20:32.939 --> 20:35.439
Our friendship is matched by none.

20:35.899 --> 20:38.819
Friendship is beautiful.

20:39.189 --> 20:40.899
That's good.

20:40.899 --> 20:41.529
Yes.

20:41.859 --> 20:44.069
So, what's the result for Shiratori-kun?

20:45.869 --> 20:47.369
He passed.

20:47.369 --> 20:49.289
For now.

20:49.289 --> 20:49.829
OK.

20:50.199 --> 20:52.159
