20:52.159 --> 20:53.789
Whatever the case is, congrats!

20:53.789 --> 20:54.329
Congrats!

20:54.419 --> 20:54.879
Congrats!

20:55.379 --> 20:58.749
You must be pretty good to get recognized by Tama-chan.

20:58.749 --> 21:00.209
R-Really?

21:00.549 --> 21:05.139
So, let's party in Shiratori-kun's room!

21:06.259 --> 21:07.889
Party!

21:07.889 --> 21:09.059
Party all night!

21:09.059 --> 21:09.639
How could that turn into that!?
Party all night!

21:09.639 --> 21:12.019
How could that turn into that!?

21:21.649 --> 21:23.199
Tamami-chan!

21:25.449 --> 21:30.369
It's a good plant, so you'd better handle it with care.

21:30.369 --> 21:31.999
When did you get here?

21:31.999 --> 21:34.039
Besides, you're holding it with one hand.

21:36.079 --> 21:37.629
